            "text": "<p>A powerful 1500W single-fan bypass motor provides an impressive 210 air watts of suction power. This Vacmaster generates a maximum airflow of 35 L/s and 18 kPa of vacuum pressure, to ensure thorough cleaning. The bypass motor channels air independently to cool the motor, resulting in enhanced efficiency and superior performance.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
