            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Built to Last",
            "text": "<p>Tough and durable 18 Litre impact resistant collection tank and metal castors. Lightweight and compact this wet & dry vacuum can fit underneath a workbench or store neatly in your garage or shed. </p>",
